@host = http://localhost:5205
@apiKey = gelistirme-anahtari

### Create a shipment (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/shipments
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderName": "Ayşe Yılmaz",
  "receiverName": "Mehmet Demir",
  "receiverPhone": "0532 000 00 00",
  "originCity": "İstanbul",
  "destinationCity": "Burdur",
  "weightKg": 2.5
}

### List shipments (admin). Optional: ?status=InTransit
GET {{host}}/api/shipments
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Add an event (admin). Take the tracking number from the response above.
POST {{host}}/api/shipments/KT0000000000/events
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InTransit",
  "location": "Ankara Aktarma Merkezi",
  "note": "Transfer merkezinden çıktı."
}

### Public tracking lookup
GET {{host}}/api/track/KT0000000000
